[[SECTION]]
UID: L0-VISION-IMPACT
TITLE: Expected impact

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
Quantify where possible. Use IMPACT_TYPE to separate the three kinds this
audience reads differently: `Quantitative` for measurable operational change,
`Qualitative` for real effects that resist measurement, `Financial` for money.
Set BASELINE and TARGET wherever a number exists - a target without a baseline
cannot be evaluated later.
<<<

