[[SECTION]]
UID: L0-CONSTRAINTS
TITLE: Constraints

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
The four subsections below are the framework's constraint categories. Use
CONSTRAINT_TYPE `Resource`, `Budget` or `Timeline` for the first three; for the
fourth, use the more specific `Legal`, `Technical`, `Organisational` or
`Operational` rather than `Other` where one fits.

Use BREAKDOWN for the detail this audience expects: cost components and funding
sources on a budget constraint, team and capacity on a resource constraint,
critical dates on a timeline constraint.
<<<

