STATEMENT: >>>
*Optional section.* Include it when the brief documents a formal decision with
defined success criteria, structured risk assessment, or explicit Go/No-Go
conditions. The brief can stand without it when the decision context is
straightforward - in that case delete the whole section rather than filling it
with placeholders.
<<<

